    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Tree Provides, The Tree Protects, The Tree Prevails!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark Switch is a vertical survival city builder set in the boughs of a gigantic\u00a0tree. Defend your leafy home against the perils of the creeping fog by managing light and flame.<strong> </strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gather resources</strong>, <strong>research technologies</strong>, and send pioneers to explore the ruins of those who came before: discover their secrets and doom. \u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in a world of folk horror and creeping dread, DarkSwitch blends vertical <strong>city-building</strong>, <strong>tower defense</strong>, and <strong>exploration</strong> into a unique strategic experience. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate a stunning, dangerous, dark fantasy world enriched by cinematic cutscenes and an atmospheric soundtrack from Silent Hill composer <strong>Akira Yamaoka</strong>!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3132870/extras/d646e19d8a2b5a3efc59cd0e4b6ebb12.poster.avif?t=1754480896\" width=616 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3132870/extras/d646e19d8a2b5a3efc59cd0e4b6ebb12.webm?t=1754480896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3132870/extras/d646e19d8a2b5a3efc59cd0e4b6ebb12.mp4?t=1754480896\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build your city upwards, utilizing both trunk and bough.</strong> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Limited horizontal space</strong> requires a strategy; construct zip lines and stairways to connect your growing settlement layers. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage raw and processed resources</strong>, production facilities, and citizen morale, while fortifying defenses to withstand fog's creeping chaos.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3132870/extras/871c795c3c6049086c1db1af8bd1a321.poster.avif?t=1754480896\" width=616 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3132870/extras/871c795c3c6049086c1db1af8bd1a321.webm?t=1754480896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3132870/extras/871c795c3c6049086c1db1af8bd1a321.mp4?t=1754480896\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Fog  drives your citizens to madness and conceals stalking terrors.</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight back by illuminating paths, crafting light-powered weapons</strong>, and mastering the raw energy of Solium.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Push back the gloom</strong> and save your nation. </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3132870/extras/e4866f37018a6946872b298b08213ed4.poster.avif?t=1754480896\" width=616 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3132870/extras/e4866f37018a6946872b298b08213ed4.webm?t=1754480896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3132870/extras/e4866f37018a6946872b298b08213ed4.mp4?t=1754480896\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Send scout detachments into the misty unknown to chart new airship routes.</strong>\u00a0</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Establish far-outposts, and excavate rare resources and artifacts. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter strange and lethal creatures lurking in the fog.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the remnants of an ancient civilization. </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3132870/extras/519083327560fcfac200b237b4af9bac.poster.avif?t=1754480896\" width=616 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3132870/extras/519083327560fcfac200b237b4af9bac.webm?t=1754480896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3132870/extras/519083327560fcfac200b237b4af9bac.mp4?t=1754480896\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Shape your citizens' destiny through morally complex decisions</strong>. </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Witness various dramatic storylines.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate choices where even small actions can spiral into grim consequences.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3132870/extras/1764305358c5c248e2843cb270b4ed49.avif?t=1754480896\" width=616 height=154 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Campaign Mode:</strong> <strong>12+ hours</strong> of single-player, story-driven gameplay with quests, branching narratives, and high-stakes choices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sandbox Mode: </strong>Open endless gameplay, where only survival is the challenge!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>80+ unique buildings</strong> for full tree city customization.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>11 resource types</strong>: balance raw and processed goods to survive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4 technology levels</strong> to advance and unlock new growth possibilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>200-meter-tall tree</strong>\u00a0that serves as the foundation for your city.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric soundtrack </strong>composed by <strong>Akira Yamaoka</strong> (<i>Silent Hill</i> series).<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3132870/extras/606c518046f94120af41c043fcb1290e.poster.avif?t=1754480896\" width=720 height=720 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3132870/extras/606c518046f94120af41c043fcb1290e.webm?t=1754480896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li></ul>",
